<section class="tt-hero"><div class="wrap tt-hero-grid"><div><div class="tt-eyebrow">TIMETRACK FOR ULTIMA SERIES</div><h1><span>Every Employee Interaction.</span><span>Captured. Guided. Controlled.</span></h1><p class="tt-hero-sub">Workforce Data Collection at the Point of Interaction.</p><p class="tt-hero-copy">TimeTrack transforms Ultima Series devices into workforce data collection points for time, labor, self-service and configured workforce controls.</p><div class="tt-pills"><span class="tt-pill time">TIME</span><span class="tt-pill labor">LABOR</span><span class="tt-pill self">SELF-SERVICE</span><span class="tt-pill control">CONTROLS</span></div><div class="tt-btns"><a class="tt-btn primary" href="#experience">Explore TimeTrack →</a><a class="tt-btn ghost" href="contact.html">Talk to Our Team</a></div></div><div class="device-showcase actual-device" aria-label="TimeTrack on an Ultima Series device"><div class="device-glow"></div><img class="hero-ultima" src="assets/ultima-7.png" alt="Ultima 7 running TimeTrack"/><div class="powered hero-powered">Powered by TimeTrack</div></div></div></section>
